            "id": "721850601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "木南杏奈",
            "text": "唉，也许我真的不太会做「披萨」这种菜吧…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7218507",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721850701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721850701": {
            "id": "721850701",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "松本",
            "text": "那种「烤蘑菇披萨」味道可是很不错的，有机会的话你一定要去尝尝看。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}